From e46f7a71a0382afa5c575de5e9887bf67c06f5c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stan Seibert <sseibert@anaconda.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Sep 2025 14:26:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Add release note

---
 docs/upcoming_changes/10237.cuda.rst | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 docs/upcoming_changes/10237.cuda.rst

diff --git a/docs/upcoming_changes/10237.cuda.rst b/docs/upcoming_changes/10237.cuda.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..a827a88601f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/upcoming_changes/10237.cuda.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+Fix CUDA target crash bug with NVIDIA driver version 580
+--------------------------------------------------------
+
+Fixes a bug in the CUDA driver wrapper that caused the CUDA target to
+crash with NVIDIA driver version 580 and later.  This was already
+fixed in the `numba-cuda` package, but has been backported here for
+users who haven't migrated yet.  (We still encourage all CUDA users to
+switch to the `numba-cuda` package for the most up to date CUDA
+support in Numba.)

